The fixtures in this folder are device captures and test vectors taken from two projects, used here as decoder
test inputs under their MIT licences.

adverts.json, gatt.json, records.json and s4-capture.json come from
- oralb-ble (https://github.com/Bluetooth-Devices/oralb-ble), Copyright (c) 2022 J. Nick Koston
- oralb-ha (https://github.com/thomasgregg/oralb-ha), Copyright (c) 2026 Thomas Gregg, including its hardware
  validation capture of 2026-08-26 and the protocol-6 samples published in its issue tracker.

The oralb-io project is under the GPL-3 and is not used: no code and no fixture of it is copied here.
Addresses in the captures are anonymised by the projects' authors.

